{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24222","headline":"诗酒琴人例多薄命予酷好三事雅当此科而所得已多爲幸斯甚偶成狂咏聊写媿怀 · 白居易","name":"诗酒琴人例多薄命予酷好三事雅当此科而所得已多爲幸斯甚偶成狂咏聊写媿怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱琴爱酒爱诗客，多贱多穷多苦辛。\n中散步兵终不贵，孟郊张籍过於贫。\n一之已叹关於命，三者何堪并在身。\n只合飘零随草木，谁教凌厉出风尘。\n荣名厚禄二千石，乐饮闲游三十春。\n何得无厌时咄咄，犹言薄命不如人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}